    "title": "Pucallpa – Ucayali living landscape boundary",
    "description": "Canonical MOSAIC delineation of the Pucallpa – Ucayali living landscape (PER-PCL), used to define the landscape across the catalogue. Source: INEI referential census district limits (cartography of the V Censo Nacional Economico 2022; 'Distrital' layer, ide.inei.gob.pe): 11 whole districts of Coronel Portillo and Padre Abad provinces (Ucayali) and a clipped part of Calleria. Full-detail Shapefile and GeoPackage in the dated release boundaries-2026-10-14 of MOSAIC-mfl/catalog; a simplified outline is attached to the landscape's STAC collection.",
